{"text": "From \u2018Sainz, Cristian\n\nSent ruse, August 24, 200040 PM\nTer man, Ange\nee Ea Nchae Brinton, Marty kl, Ja Osbome, Kevin (PHIMG Lega; Krasse, Carte; As,\nSubject: AF iam\nAndy,\n\nThave been trying unsuccessfully to contact Agent Maxey since August 21st. His office claims they\ndo not know of his whereabouts (apparently he is in Boston). On Tuesday, I made contact with\nanother Customs inspector, Mr. Cox, who asked for details of the containers so that he could check\nthe status. He promised to call me back, but I haven't heard from him (L also tried his mobile and\npager), Today I contacted specialist Wilson, who promised to locate Maxey and Cox to ask them to\ncall me with confirmation of the date of inspection.\n\nAs soon as T hear from Customs, I will ask Charlie Krausse to inspect the goods in Miami, Charlie is\ncone of our product experts from PM USA\n\nRegards.\n\nCristian Sainz\nPh: (917) 663-3059\nFax: (817) 663-5312\n\nNote: The information in this email, and in any attachments, may contain confidential information and is\nintended solely for the attention and use of the named addressee(s). If you are not the intended recipient,\n(of a person responsible for delivering it fo the intended recipient, you are not authorized to, and must not,\ndisclose, copy, distribute, or retain this message or any part of it\n\n99068291802",
